  "E[g(X)] se calcule avec ∫ g(x)·f(x) dx ; en général, ce n'est pas g(E[X]).": "E[g(X)] is computed with ∫ g(x)·f(x) dx; in general, it is not g(E[X]).",
  "E[Ȳ] = E[Y] = 3θ/4 ≠ θ : Ȳ est biaisé (biais −θ/4). Avec θ = 1, E[Ȳ] = 3/4.": "E[Ȳ] = E[Y] = 3θ/4 ≠ θ: Ȳ is biased (bias −θ/4). With θ = 1, E[Ȳ] = 3/4.",
  "Effectifs attendus uniformes": "Uniform expected counts",
