  "On teste H₀ : p₁ = p₂ contre H₁ : p₁ ≠ p₂ au niveau 5 %.": "H₀: p₁ = p₂ is tested against H₁: p₁ ≠ p₂ at level 5 %.",
  "On teste H₀ : μ = {m0} contre H₁ : μ > {m0}. On rejette H₀. En réalité, μ = {m1}. Quelle erreur a-t-on commise ?": "H₀: μ = {m0} is tested against H₁: μ > {m0}. H₀ is rejected. In reality, μ = {m1}. Which error was made?",
  "On tire d'un coup : l'ordre ne compte pas. (On peut aussi tout compter avec ordre, mais alors en haut et en bas.)": "The draw is made at once: order does not matter. (You can also count everything with order, but then on top and at the bottom.)",
